{"id":"d_main_28_02","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch28","label":"Chapter 28 · The Unknown"},"label":"A Little Further","stage":"28-9 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_28_01_e","next":"d_main_28_03","speakers":{"anis":"Anis","neon":"Neon","rapi":"Rapi","shifty":"Shifty"},"icons":{"anis":"si_c012_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s","shifty":"si_c907_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_28_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_1","text":"Commander. Can we talk for a moment?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CrystalCity","bgArt":"crystalcity","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_distress","movie":null,"shown":["neon","anis","rapi"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_2","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_2","text":"What's up?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_3","text":"I've been thinking about it, and I really do feel this is too dangerous.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_4","text":"How about we go back?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_5","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_5","text":"We've already come this far. I don't want to go back empty-handed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_6","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_7","text":"I think you're pushing this too far.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_8","text":"This isn't that much different from missions we've done in the past.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_9","text":"Master has a point.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_10","text":"We've been in far worse situations before，","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_11","text":"and this isn't all that dissimilar to other predicaments we've been in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_12","text":"But my firepower sensor is going off big time, Commander. Something is dangerous about this place.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_13","text":"We've never been so in the dark regarding our surroundings.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_14","text":"In every mission we've been on before, we had at least a cursory knowledge of the surface and the Rapture presence.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_15","text":"Here, however, our surroundings are utterly alien, and so are the creatures we've encountered thus far.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_16","text":"Personally, I feel the risk of continuing is too high.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_17","text":"We also don't know how the crystals will affect humans.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_18","text":"At the very least, it would be smarter to fall back, gather our forces, and continue the search at a later date.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_19","text":"I can empathize with the others in wanting to blaze full steam ahead,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_20","text":"but to me, it's obvious: we're walking straight into danger.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_21","text":"Yes, there's a risk, but don't you all think it's worth taking?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_22","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_23","text":"Commander,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_24","text":"is there any particular reason why you're pushing yourself this much?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_25","text":"Yeah, how come you're so insistent?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_26","text":"I've never seen you like this before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_27","text":"You didn't rack up a load of debt at Coin Rush, did you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_28","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_29","text":"Wait, did you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_30","text":"Oh, Master. I understand you're under a lot of stress, but you shouldn't be indulging in such vices.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_31","text":"Well, it can't be helped. I might have to sell my prized collection...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_32","text":"I want to strengthen our position in the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_33","text":"Our position?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_34","text":"You mean like power?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_35","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_36","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_37","text":"Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_38","text":"What do you intend on using that power for?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_39","text":"I want to bring Marian back.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_40","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_41","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_42","text":"To the extent that everyone in the Ark could turn their back on us, and it wouldn't matter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_43","text":"To the point where no one would dare become our enemy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_44","text":"I want that kind of power.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_45","text":"Are you sure it's just Marian you're thinking of?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_46","text":"No. I'm thinking of you all as well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_47","text":"If the day ever comes when your back is against the wall, and you're forced to make a decision","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_48","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_48","text":"that isn't viewed favorably by those in the Ark,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_49","text":"I want to be on your side.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_50","text":"Wow, to make that possible, you'd really need to be on top of the pile.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_51","text":"When that happens, would you offer me a position?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_52","text":"No.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_53","text":"Hey! Not fair!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_54","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_54","text":"I'm no politician.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_55","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_55","text":"The only way for me to obtain that kind of power, especially in the Ark,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_56","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_56","text":"would be through doing things that no one else has done.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_57","text":"Okay. I understand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_58","text":"... Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_59","text":"How far are you willing to go?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_60","text":"Honestly, I don't...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_61","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_62","text":"No. Never mind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_63","text":"Good for you. Three cheers for the Commander's bright future!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_64","text":"Can't you at least offer me a secretary position?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_65","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_65","text":"No.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_66","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_66","text":"Because by then, you'll be working alongside me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_67","text":"*Gasp*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_68","text":"I'm not worthy! Please forgive your foolish disciple who was blinded by desire.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_69","text":"Shifty.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["shifty"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_70","text":"I'll strike this conversation from the record.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_71","text":"Half of these statements the Commander made are tantamount to a declaration of war.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_72","text":"To do such a thing when you're not yet prepared will end in disaster.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_73","text":"I don't want anything bad to befall the Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_74","text":"Thank you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_75","text":"Having said that, it would be wise to familiarize yourself with the basics of politics, Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_76","text":"The same word can have many different meanings depending on the context.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_02_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_02_77","text":"Once this search mission is through, I'll send you more information through a private line.","jump